OL,10,G1600 Composer of the Week: Falla
OL,11,     F3/5. Kate Molleson explores
OL,12,     FSpanish composer Manuel de Falla's
OL,13,     Flife in five cities. When Falla
OL,14,     Farrives in Paris, he soon
OL,15,     Fbefriends Paul Dukas and Claude
OL,16,     FDebussy.
